## Next boundary

Track 6 item 2 remains active. Next Slice must compare approved Guardian classifier families with the actual typed telemetry and current `BottleneckKind` coverage, extending classification only where evidence authority is real and preserving explicit `Unknown` for unsupported/unproven causal families.

Do not advance to Track 6 item 3 session optimizer actions until item 2 is capability-honest and complete for the intended current foundation.
